abstract: "A controlled synthetic benchmark comparing REST orchestration with Kafka choreography behind one asynchronous mobile-money P2P transfer API, measuring correct goodput, ingress-to-commit completion latency, fault response and ledger correctness. Includes the code, the redacted run evidence and reproducible analysis for an exploratory 16-run study and a replicated 207-run campaign on one frozen build (ten order-balanced pairs for the main conditions, an outbox polling sweep, a batched-dispatch test, a load ladder and four crash faults), the exploratory study's paper draft, and a Swagger UI for the API."
